BT 1 0 0 1 0 111 Tm /F1 9 Tf 12 TL (Ten foundational anomalies in quantum mechanics and particle physics are resolved through the coherence decay function) Tj T* (C = C_0 exp\(-alpha gamma_eff\). The measurement problem, quantum entanglement, Wigner's Friend paradox, quantum) Tj T* (Darwinism, CPT symmetry, quantum gravity unification, the proton radius puzzle, the neutron lifetime discrepancy, the) Tj T* (proton spin crisis, and the Boltzmann brain problem each yield to a single principle: coherence is a relational,) Tj T* (regime-dependent quantity that undergoes phase transitions at a critical decoherence rate gamma_c. Measurement is not) Tj T* (an interpretive choice but a physical phase transition. Entanglement is not nonlocal influence but spatially extended) Tj T* (coherence. Observer paradoxes dissolve because coherence is observer-relative. Quantum mechanics and general) Tj T* (relativity describe different coherence regimes of the same underlying physics. Each anomaly is closed with explicit) Tj T* (mechanisms, equations, and testable predictions. This paper extends Papers 5 \(REQMT\), 66 \(Bell States\), 84 \(Z2) Tj T* (Symmetry\), and 115 \(Consciousness Order Parameter\) in the AIIT-THRESI series.) Tj T* ET
